desc:SC4 Stereo Compressor
tags: dynamics compressor stereo rms peak
version: 1.0
author: citizenkeith
provides: SC4 Stereo Compressor.jsfx
about:
  # SC4 Stereo Compressor

  A JSFX port of the SC4 LADSPA compressor by Steve Harris, originally part
  of the swh-plugins collection and for two decades the default compressor
  on nearly every Linux audio system. This is a faithful reimplementation
  of the original detector and gain-computer math rather than a plugin
  merely inspired by it.

  ## Controls
  - RMS / PEAK: Detector blend. 0 = pure RMS, 1 = pure peak.
  - ATTACK / RELEASE: Envelope follower timing.
  - THRESHOLD / RATIO: Standard downward compression.
  - KNEE: Soft-knee radius either side of the threshold.
  - MAKEUP: Output gain.

  ## Features
  - Blended RMS/peak envelope follower
  - Block-averaged RMS detection (4-sample block, as in the original)
  - Soft-knee gain computer with smoothed gain application
  - Gain reduction meter, 0 to -24 dB

  ## License
  Copyright (C) 2026 citizenkeith (Keith Hanlon).
  Based on SC4 by Steve Harris <steve@plugin.org.uk>, https://github.com/swh/ladspa
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2.
  Note: GPL v2, not v3 - the upstream SC4 grants no "or later" option.
  This program comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY.

changelog:
  1.0 - Initial release. JSFX port of Steve Harris' SC4 LADSPA compressor.
        Blended RMS/peak detection, soft-knee gain computer, GR meter.

